        <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
                <h2 id="about-heading">🌟 About Dilse &amp; Co Realty</h2>
                <p><em>Securing Your Wealth. Simplifying Your Journey.</em></p>

                <p itemprop="description">Navigating the Kenyan real estate market shouldn't feel like a gamble. At
                    Dilse &amp; Co Realty, we transform overwhelming property transactions into clear, structured, and
                    risk-free investments. We don't just list properties; we protect your capital and secure your future
                    by combining deep local market expertise with uncompromising legal due diligence.</p>

                <h3>🔎 Why Savvy Clients Choose Us</h3>
                <p>Nairobi's real estate moves fast, but pitfalls like disputed titles, surprise fees, and poorly
                    managed properties move faster. We exist to eliminate that risk. When you partner with us, you are
                    buying ultimate peace of mind. Every property in our portfolio is pre-vetted, legally secure, and
                    optimized for maximum yield so you can invest with absolute confidence.</p>

                <ul class="value-pillars">
                    <li>
                        <h4>Risk Elimination</h4>
                        <p>Every single title deed and registry history is fully verified before it reaches you. You
                            will never inherit a legal dispute or a fraudulent listing.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h4>Absolute Cost Certainty</h4>
                        <p>No hidden agency fees, no surprise closing costs. The numbers you are quoted upfront are
                            exactly what you pay.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h4>Yield-Focused Data</h4>
                        <p>We benchmark every investment against current market data, ensuring you purchase properties
                            with proven rental demand and predictable returns.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h4>End-to-End Asset Protection</h4>
                        <p>We don't disappear after closing day. From tenant sourcing to hands-off property management,
                            we protect your asset over its entire lifecycle.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>📈 Our Strategic Portfolio &amp; Expertise</h3>

                <h4>Our Story</h4>
                <p>Built on a foundation of trust, transparency, and personal attention, Dilse &amp; Co Realty began by
                    helping families secure premium homes in Nairobi's premier hubs like Westlands and Kilimani. Today,
                    we have evolved into a premier, full-service real estate brokerage handling high-value residential
                    sales, luxury rentals, strategic land acquisition, and hands-off property management.</p>

                <h4>Who We Serve &amp; How We Deliver Value</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <h5>Discerning Homebuyers</h5>
                        <p>Curated access to elite family residences and modern apartments in Nairobi's highly
                            sought-after neighborhoods, including Karen, Kilimani, and Lavington.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h5>Diaspora Investors</h5>
                        <p>A fully secure, transparent gateway to buy property remotely in Kenya. We act as your trusted
                            ground team with zero risk of mismanaged funds.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h5>Land &amp; Portfolio Growth Investors</h5>
                        <p>High-yield land opportunities vetted for immediate capital appreciation in rapidly expanding
                            investment corridors like Juja and Kangundo Road.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h5>Premium Landlords</h5>
                        <p>Maximum occupancy, rigorous tenant screening, and stress-free rental collection managed by
                            industry professionals.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

            </section>

