        <section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
            <h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p>Answers to the questions we hear most often from buyers, renters, landlords, and investors.</p>

            <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">How long does the buying process typically take?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">Most purchases close within 30 - 60 days once title deed verification and
                            financing are complete. Off-plan purchases can take longer depending on the developer's
                            construction timeline.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">Do you charge any upfront fees?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">No. Our commission is only due upon successful closing or lease signing —
                            never upfront.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">Can I buy property remotely if I'm living outside Kenya?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">Yes. We handle full title deed verification and legal due diligence on your
                            behalf, and many diaspora clients close without ever needing a site visit.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">What areas do you currently cover?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">We specialize in Karen, Kilimani, Lavington, and Westlands for residential
                            sales and rentals, plus land opportunities in Juja, Kangundo Road, and Malindi.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">How does your property management service work?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">We handle tenant relations, maintenance coordination, and rent collection on
                            your behalf, with rent payments and maintenance requests managed through a simple digital
                            system.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">How do you verify a property's title before listing it?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">Every property undergoes full title deed verification and legal due diligence
                            before it's added to our inventory, so you never inherit a hidden ownership dispute.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">What's included in your rental screening process?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">Every property is physically inspected and verified by our team before it's
                            listed, and every lease uses clear, plain-language terms with no hidden fees.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">Do you handle commercial properties, or only residential?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">Both. Alongside residential sales and rentals, we also handle retail shops,
                            office spaces, and business stalls for commercial clients.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">Can you help me determine a fair price for my property?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">Yes. Our team provides data-driven property valuations and market insights,
                            benchmarking your property against current yield and market data before you list or sell.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
                    <summary itemprop="name">What happens after I submit a consultation request?</summary>
                    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
                        <p itemprop="text">A member of our consulting desk will reach out using the phone number or
                            email you provide to schedule a consultation and discuss your specific property goals.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

            </div>

